+# HAL Engine Tool Input Validation
+
+| Field  | Value                |
+| ------ | -------------------- |
+| Issue  | re-cinq/HALEngine#37 |
+| Status | Draft                |
+
+`ToolRegistry.execute` validates a tool call against the registered tool's
+`inputSchema` before invoking its executor. A rejected input is returned as a
+`ToolResponse` whose result describes the validation failure, and the executor
+is not invoked.
+
+## Validation
+
+- `ToolRegistry.execute` rejects input missing a required property before the executor runs, returning a result that identifies that property as required ([validated by: rejects missing required tool input before invoking the executor](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L4)).
